@CLAUDE.md

`CLAUDE.md` is the single source of truth for this project — read it before making changes, and update it (not this file) when behavior changes.

Hard rules, in case the reference above isn't loaded:
- Static site on GitHub Pages; every push to `main` deploys live to the lobby TV within ~2 min. No build step.
- The TV runs Fully Kiosk Browser (old Android WebView): never use the CSS `inset` shorthand, never put spaces or parentheses in asset filenames, and keep `app.js`/`style.css` cache-busted in `index.html`.
- Always pass `timeZone: 'Asia/Jerusalem'` when formatting times.
- Havdalah/end-of-chag is computed with 8.5° solar trig (`TZEIT_DEPRESSION_DEG` in `app.js`). Do not replace it with a fixed minutes-after-sunset offset or a HebCal field.
- Music must never play while the Shabbat/Yom Tov overlay is active.
- News feeds go through the Cloudflare Worker in `worker/rss-proxy.js` (rss2json is only a fallback). Pushing to GitHub does NOT deploy the Worker — it must be pasted into the Cloudflare dashboard.
